   "titulo": "Placements with tage and få",
   "texto": [
    "With **tage** (take) it is said **tage en beslutning** (make a decision) and **tage en pause** (pause). With **få** (receive) it is said **få en idé** (have an idea): **Jeg fik en god idé.** = I came up with a good idea."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Placements with gøre and wash",
   "texto": [
    "With **gøre** (do): **gøre rent** (clean), **gøre en indsats** (strive). With **lave** (do, prepare): **lave mad** (cook), **lave lektier** (do duties).",
    "Eye: In Spanish we use «do» for everything, but in Danish each verb has its expression."
